OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABonfire event postponed due to
OL,4,Astormy weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bonfire event in West Sussex has been
OL,7,Fpostponed in the wake of Storm Austen
OL,8,Fas the UK prepares for its second named
OL,9,Fstorm to roll in.
OL,11,FLittlehampton Bonfire Society was due
OL,12,Fto host an event on Saturday but this
OL,13,Fhas been moved to Sunday, with the
OL,14,Fevent also being scaled-down.
OL,16,FBonfire events in Horsham, Ninfield and
OL,17,FAshurst Wood have also been called off
OL,18,Fin the past few days.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
