OL,3,GNEWSABonfire event postponed due to
OL,4,Astormy weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoads, railways, ferries and flights
OL,7,Fwere affected across Kent, Surrey and
OL,8,FSussex on Friday, and part of
OL,9,FBrighton's West Pier collapsed as the
OL,10,Ffirst named storm this winter moved
OL,11,Fthrough the region.
